["20260628175152381686_6ef8d955"], "citations": [4]}, {"id": 
"20260628175224215759_2d31cb29", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"论文将戒指作为“pseudo-Minoan”物件进行讨论，并提到其“gold signet 
ring”“exceptionally large oval 
bezel”以及刻线风格是否符合青铜时代技术特征的问题。", "source_ids": 
["20260628175152381686_6ef8d955"], "citations": [4]}, {"id": 
"20260628175224306336_fe717e12", "type": "Evidence", "text": "开头提到“(a) Three
bead-seals of the type described as 'flattened cylinders.' (b) A large signet 
ring with an exceptionally large oval bezel. (c) Another, smaller, with a 
…”，将“大型印章戒指”与三枚扁平圆柱形珠印和另一枚较小戒指区分开来。", 
"source_ids": ["20260628175221372282_f25eeb76"], "citations": [16]}, {"id": 
"20260628175224394591_008f743a", "type": "Evidence", "text": "文中将“THE RING OF
NESTOR. (EVANS, PM. IV, FIG. 915b)”作为参照，表明该戒指已在《Palace of 
Minos》卷四图版915b中刊行。", "source_ids": ["20260628175221372282_f25eeb76"], 
"citations": [16]}, {"id": "20260628175224486106_949a2fe4", "type": "Evidence", 
"text": "论文指出这一戒指在Geometric times后“fell into 
