["20260628175221372282_f25eeb76"], "citations": [16]}, {"id": 
"20260628175224582229_757a097b", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"书的目录显示分为“I. Sepulchral treasure of gold signet-rings and bead-seals 
from Thisbê, Boeotia”与“II. A glimpse into the Minoan 
