图像布局的视觉证据。", "source_ids": ["20260628175221412008_d63425e4"], 
"citations": [17]}, {"id": "20260628175224859263_eb7577ae", "type": "Evidence", 
"text": "HathiTrust目录记录书名为“ʻThe ring of Nestor;̓ a glimpse into the Minoan
