["20260628175159168030_6bbf9c82"], "citations": [10]}, {"id": 
"20260628175202488168_f8a58f35", "type": "Evidence", "text": "“Prompted by 
Wace’s publication of his excavations at Mycenae (Wace 1921–1923), Evans 
responded in an article, ‘The Ring of Nestor’, JHS 45 (1925), 1–75…”", 
"source_ids": ["20260628175159201229_12a3821a"], "citations": [11]}, {"id": 
"20260628175202577242_fdd5b6db", "type": "Evidence", "text": "文章指出 Evans 
将“Ring of 
