的论证。", "source_ids": ["20260628175159201229_12a3821a"], "citations": [11]}, 
{"id": "20260628175202663478_9031196d", "type": "Evidence", "text": "文中讨论 
Wace 对 Evans 时间框架与解释的质疑，反映该戒指在 20 
世纪早期迈锡尼年代学与史学争论中的核心地位。", "source_ids": 
["20260628175159201229_12a3821a"], "citations": [11]}, {"id": 
"20260628175202756991_73866629", "type": "Evidence", "text": "“… (1985, 51) 
profers interesting comments on the ring of Nestor. … Excellent illustrations 
and a discussion on dating are provided by the …”", "source_ids": 
["20260628175159232040_d16a1ac9"], "citations": [12]}, {"id": 
"20260628175202850920_f67eaed7", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"作者通过把伊索帕塔戒指和“Ring of Nestor”等置于同一图像学与宗教语境中，对 
epiphany 场景的传统解释提出质疑。", "source_ids": 
["20260628175159232040_d16a1ac9"], "citations": [12]}, {"id": 
"20260628175202948822_bfdaaf88", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"文中引用其他学者对“Ring of 
Nestor”年代与图像意义的讨论，显示存在不同看法：有的强调米诺斯宫廷宗教背景，有的
更倾向于晚期迈锡尼王权与葬礼语境。", "source_ids": 
["20260628175159232040_d16a1ac9"], "citations": [12]}, {"id": 
"20260628175203059115_e526de77", "type": "Evidence", "text": "“Analysis of over 
165 Mycenaean gold items from Volos and Dimini tholoi. … ‘The ring of Nestor’. A
glimpse into the Minoan after-world. London …”", "source_ids": 
["20260628175159269958_24d76d9b"], "citations": [13]}, {"id": 
"20260628175203159120_a14fb2e8", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"文中通过比较这些有确切墓葬背景的金戒指与“Ring of 
Nestor”，讨论风格与制作技术的一致性与差异。", "source_ids": 
["20260628175159269958_24d76d9b"], "citations": [13]}, {"id": 
"20260628175203252074_06e1d78a", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"作者指出戒指被视作米诺斯或迈锡尼金工的代表案例，但其缺乏可靠发掘记录使得年代与
文化归属一直有争议。", "source_ids": ["20260628175159269958_24d76d9b"], 
"citations": [13]}, {"id": "20260628175203338632_6953be62", "type": "Evidence", 
"text": "书目条目：“‘The Ring of Nestor and the Quest for Authenticity.’ pp. 
